From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: krane <chris@krane.dev>
Date: Sat, 28 Nov 2026 17:13:07 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] fix(notifications): use the schedule icon for time
 notifications

Backport of pctrade/end4-pC e3bb865 (icon hunk only)
https://github.com/pctrade/end4-pC/commit/e3bb865
Problem: the time notification icon was the nonexistent Material symbol "scheduleb".
Port: hand-port, one line; the other hunks of the fork commit are not ported
Drop when: the pinned NotificationUtils maps "time" to "schedule".
---
 .../ii/modules/common/functions/NotificationUtils.qml           | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/dots/.config/quickshell/ii/modules/common/functions/NotificationUtils.qml b/dots/.config/quickshell/ii/modules/common/functions/NotificationUtils.qml
index d6adcc0f..a56f1c2c 100644
--- a/dots/.config/quickshell/ii/modules/common/functions/NotificationUtils.qml
+++ b/dots/.config/quickshell/ii/modules/common/functions/NotificationUtils.qml
@@ -18,7 +18,7 @@ Singleton {
             'power': 'power',
             'screenshot': 'screenshot_monitor',
             'welcome': 'waving_hand',
-            'time': 'scheduleb',
+            'time': 'schedule',
             'installed': 'download',
             'configuration reloaded': 'reset_wrench',
             'unable': 'question_mark',
